{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1000972-help-me-list-some-curses","id":1000972,"title":"Help me list some curses","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-09T14:08:51-08:00","id":1000972,"title":"Help me list some curses","content":"i asked my GM if my character could be cursed in our next campaign and he said &quot;possibly, give me a list of examples next time we meet and if it is spontaneous yet doesn't detract from the story i will consider what you suggested or make something else up myself.&quot;<br /> <br /> \u200bi was wondering if anyone here would like to contribute to my list of curse types, i'm obviously not going to list Vampirism or Lycanthropy because i could simply play a werewolf or vampire but here is my list so far:<br /> <br /> <br /> Random bad luck, traditional and simple<br /> <br /> Death sentence time frame<br /> <br /> Random sleep Narcolepsy style, with nightmares<br /> <br /> \u200bBlind, mute, or deaf by supernatural means<br /> <br /> Bloodlust and/or need to kill<br /> <br /> \u200bUnable to keep possessions, they mysteriously break and/or disappear<br /> <br /> Does not gain Experience at the end of a chapter<br /> <br /> Physically weaker and/or slower<br /> <br /> \u200bPsychological bad flashes of like Hell or just random events like bad memories<br /> <br /> Physical disfigurement like the beast or Medusa<br /> <br /> Socially unlikable<br /> <br /> \u200bTurns people and/or objects into something else when touched king Midas style<br /> <br /> Targeted by animals both domestic and wild<br /> <br /> Unable to heal<br /> <br /> \u200bUnable to kill others by strange circumstance intervening<br /> <br /> Hunted by a Supernatural being(s)<br /> <br /> Haunted by ghost<br /> <br /> Easy to notice, unable to hide and stickouts<br /> <br /> Unable to retain a home<br /> <br /> Unable to retain money<br /> <br /> \u200bScares easily, unable to draw courage<br /> <br /> People turn on you<br /> <br /> Becoming crazy and/or hateful<br /> <br /> Technology tries to harm and/or kill you<br /> <br /> People you care for get hurt and/or die<br /> <br /> Circumstantial transformation Ranma 1/2 style<br /> <br /> \u200bPeople can't think properly around you<br /> <br /> \u200bCan never rest","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12063,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","user":"Seta143","date":". 11-09-2016, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T14:26:57-08:00","id":1000980,"title":"","content":"Everyone else succeeds around you while you fail at everything (anti-luck thief, basically).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T18:06:24-08:00","id":1001110,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Hexes</b><br /> <br /> <i>Bane:</i> A relatively common element, material or environment becomes a mortal threat<br /> <i>Blight:</i> Your presence enervates the environment - meat rots, plants wither, milk spoils, and the pregnant miscarry.<br /> <i>Fade Away:</i> The world forgets you. Your information fades from public record, people you have known forget that you exist, and new people forget you moments after meeting you.<br /> <i>Doppelganger:</i> You gain an&quot;evil&quot; twin.This double has all your memories and skills, and is dedicated to ruining your life by any means necessary.<br /> <i>Flycatcher:</i> A particular type of vermin is drawn to your presence, typically creatures such as fleas, flies, rats or roaches. Any place you rest for more than a day is quickly overrun.<br /> <i>Fortean Event:</i> Strange occurrences follow you- rains of frogs, water that runs black, walls that drip blood or other phenomena appear wherever you rest for more than a day.<br /> <i>Fragile:</i> Your flesh becomes thin and your bones become brittle; even minor trauma can result in severe injury.<br /> <i>Leper:</i> You display the physical symptoms of a contagious illness (but don't actually have the disease). These symptoms may cause you to become shunned in social situations.<br /> <i>Liars Plague:</i> Telling lies produces some type of physical reaction,from coughing up scarabs to your nose growing.<br /> <i>Pained Immortality:</i> You become immune to death, but with some terrible drawback to make the idea of living forever with it torturous.<br /> <i>Malefactor:</i> People in your presence give in to their base impulses and can only recover willpower from their Vice.<br /> <i>Polymorph:</i> You have been turned into an animal (typically something small, weak or ignoble). While you retain your human mind, your capabilities are limited by those of the shape you are in.<br /> <i>Radical Honesty:</i> You are incapable of exaggeration, lying or uttering any statement you believe to be untrue (this include using sarcasm or irony).<br /> <i>Sticky Fingers:</i> Stolen goods appear on your person and you have no recollection of how it got there. These items are rarely useful and always cause some form of long or short term trouble.<br /> <i>Thinner:</i> You are wasting away. No matter what or how much you eat, none of it nourishes you and you will starve to death in due time.<br /> <i>Typhoid:</i> You become a carrier of a disease; spreading it to those around you but never suffering or succumbing to it yourself.<br /> <i>Unnatural Appetite:</i> In order to survive, you must consume a strange substance (such as blood or flesh, or even weirder like hair or excrement).<br /> <i>Unutterable:</i> You cannot communicate about a particular topic- trying to speak of it mutes the voice or induces a outburst of nonsense. Other types of communication (such as writing or sign language) are similarly hindered.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T13:21:57-08:00","id":1003034,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the suggestions i have added them all to the list","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T17:14:54-08:00","id":1003149,"title":"","content":"Food tastes like ashes.<br /> You will have a brush with death every day.<br /> You must die once (no more, no less) every day.<br /> Your life force is tied to someone else. Probably someone you can't stand.<br /> All your accomplishments will be credited to another.<br /> Everyone who remains in your presence for more than an hour will acquire a random curse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T18:16:17-08:00","id":1003179,"title":"","content":"One that is typically combined with one or more other curses is the inability to die or be put into an indefinite state in which you remain unaware, such as a coma.<br /> <br /> Also, being subjected to crippling pain when performing certain (probably common/expected) actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2309,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","user":"Ashenrogue","date":". 11-14-2016, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T21:07:02-08:00","id":1003227,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1003222-minor-template-murderer\">Crows follow you wherever you go.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/838957-minor-template-they-bleed-snakes\">You bleed snakes now. Enjoy.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/935770-abyssal-anomaly-the-living-stones\">A deep and undeniable part of you now wishes to become a meat palace.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815201-minor-template-the-empty\">The only way you can be close to people is stealing their identities.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/855409-condition-set-eyes-of-the-devil\">Your eyes now violate and dirty everything they see.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}